{"content":"<h2 id=\"说明\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#说明\"><span>说明</span></a></h2>\n<p>想要在锻造心得板块发布心得目前有以下几种方法:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>通过发布页面<Badge type=\"tip\" text=\"推荐\" /></li>\n<li>将文章编辑好后发给群管理员<mark>@好久是多久</mark><Badge type=\"warning\" text=\"缓慢\" /></li>\n<li>fork百科仓库，用Markdown编写后将内容放进<code v-pre>docs</code>/<code v-pre>blog</code>/<code v-pre>experience</code>内，然后推送并等待更新<Badge type=\"danger\" text=\"技术难度高\" /><Badge type=\"warning\" text=\"缓慢\" /></li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"hint-container note\">\n<p class=\"hint-container-title\">注</p>\n<p>编写前请务必阅读下方<a href=\"#%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3markdown%E8%AF%AD%E6%B3%95\">Markdown语法</a>，除了通用语法还有一些<mark><a href=\"#%E6%8B%93%E5%B1%95%E8%AF%AD%E6%B3%95\">拓展语法</a></mark>可以让你的文章排版更有趣！<br>\n比如下面这种效果↓↓↓<br>\n<Plot>不要怕Markdown没有多难的一看就会🤗</Plot></p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"通过发布页面\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#通过发布页面\"><span>通过发布页面</span></a></h2>\n<div class=\"vp-steps\"><ol>\n<li><strong>进入后你会看见如下界面输入账号密码登录</strong>\n<img src=\"/blog/image/mustread/image4.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></li>\n<li><strong>登录后会显示已有文章</strong>\n<img src=\"/blog/image/mustread/image3.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<ul>\n<li>点击<code v-pre>新建文章</code>即可创建新的心得或攻略</li>\n<li>点击<mark class=\"important\">列表内的文章</mark>即可修改已经发布的文章</li>\n<li><mark class=\"danger\">请不要随意修改他人的文章</mark></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>编辑界面如下图所示填写相关信息</strong>\n<img src=\"/blog/image/mustread/image2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"hint-container tip\">\n<p class=\"hint-container-title\">提示</p>\n<ul>\n<li>左侧为信息界面，右侧为预览界面</li>\n<li class=\"important\">预览不是最终效果！</li>\n<li><mark class=\"warning\">作者为必填项</mark></li>\n<li>按顺序填写即可</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li><strong>已存在的文章点击即可进入修改页面</strong><div class=\"hint-container caution\">\n<p class=\"hint-container-title\"><strong>请不要修改他人文章！</strong></p>\n</div>\n<img src=\"/blog/image/mustread/image1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></li>\n</ol>\n</div><h2 id=\"相关markdown语法\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#相关markdown语法\"><span>相关Markdown语法</span></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"通用语法\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#通用语法\"><span>通用语法</span></a></h3>\n<h4 id=\"段落和换行\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#段落和换行\"><span>段落和换行</span></a></h4>\n<p>一个段落是由一个以上相连接的行句组成，而一个以上的空行则会切分出不同的段落。</p>\n<p>如果需要换行请在两个段落间添加空行，或在上一个段落的结尾添加<mark>两个空格</mark>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"标题\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#标题\"><span>标题</span></a></h4>\n<p>文字前加<code v-pre>#</code>和<strong>一个空格</strong>为标题，标题级别由<code v-pre>#</code>数量决定</p>\n<div class=\"language-md line-numbers-mode\" data-highlighter=\"shiki\" data-ext=\"md\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code\" v-pre=\"\"><code class=\"language-md\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#666666;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">#</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#1C6B48;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#4D9375;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> This is an H1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#666666;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">##</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#1C6B48;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#4D9375;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> This is an H2</span></span></code></pre>\n<div class=\"line-numbers\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"counter-reset:line-number 0\"><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div></div></div><p>在行首插入 1 到 6 个 <code v-pre>#</code> ，对应到标题 1 到 6 阶，例如:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>H1: <code v-pre># Header 1</code></li>\n<li>H2: <code v-pre>## Header 2</code></li>\n<li>H3: <code v-pre>### Header 3</code></li>\n<li>H4: <code v-pre>#### Header 4</code></li>\n<li>H5: <code v-pre>##### Header 5</code></li>\n<li>H6: <code v-pre>###### Header 6</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"引言\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#引言\"><span>引言</span></a></h4>\n<p>引言是在在每行的最前面加上 <code v-pre>&gt;</code> :</p>\n<div class=\"language-md line-numbers-mode\" data-highlighter=\"shiki\" data-ext=\"md\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code\" v-pre=\"\"><code class=\"language-md\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2E808F;--shiki-dark:#5D99A9\"> This is a blockquote with two paragraphs. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2E808F;--shiki-dark:#5D99A9\"> consectetuer adipiscing elit. Aliquam hendrerit mi posuere lectus.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2E808F;--shiki-dark:#5D99A9\"> Vestibulum enim wisi, viverra nec, fringilla in, laoreet vitae, risus.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2E808F;--shiki-dark:#5D99A9\"> Donec sit amet nisl. Aliquam semper ipsum sit amet velit. Suspendisse</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2E808F;--shiki-dark:#5D99A9\"> id sem consectetuer libero luctus adipiscing.</span></span></code></pre>\n<div class=\"line-numbers\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"counter-reset:line-number 0\"><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div></div></div><p>渲染为如下效果：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Vestibulum enim wisi, viverra nec, fringilla in, laoreet vitae, risus.</p>\n<p>Donec sit amet nisl. Aliquam semper ipsum sit amet velit. Suspendisse\nid sem consectetuer libero luctus adipiscing.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>要是两行引言分开请在其间插入空行 :</p>\n<div class=\"language-md line-numbers-mode\" data-highlighter=\"shiki\" data-ext=\"md\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code\" v-pre=\"\"><code class=\"language-md\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2E808F;--shiki-dark:#5D99A9\"> Vestibulum enim wisi, viverra nec, fringilla in, laoreet vitae, risus.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2E808F;--shiki-dark:#5D99A9\"> Donec sit amet nisl. Aliquam semper ipsum sit amet velit. Suspendisse</span></span></code></pre>\n<div class=\"line-numbers\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"counter-reset:line-number 0\"><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div></div></div><p>渲染效果如下：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Vestibulum enim wisi, viverra nec, fringilla in, laoreet vitae, risus.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Donec sit amet nisl. Aliquam semper ipsum sit amet velit. Suspendisse</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>块引言可以有阶层，只要根据层数加上不同数量的 <code v-pre>&gt;</code> :</p>\n<div class=\"language-md line-numbers-mode\" data-highlighter=\"shiki\" data-ext=\"md\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code\" v-pre=\"\"><code class=\"language-md\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2E808F;--shiki-dark:#5D99A9\"> This is the first level of quoting.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> ></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2E808F;--shiki-dark:#5D99A9\"> This is nested blockquote.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2E808F;--shiki-dark:#5D99A9\"> Back to the first level.</span></span></code></pre>\n<div class=\"line-numbers\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"counter-reset:line-number 0\"><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div></div></div><p>渲染效果如下：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This is the first level of quoting.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This is nested blockquote.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Back to the first level.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>引言的块内也可以使用其他的 Markdown 语法，包括标题、列表、代码块等</p>\n<h4 id=\"列表\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#列表\"><span>列表</span></a></h4>\n<p>有序列表和无序列表。</p>\n<p>无序列表:</p>\n<div class=\"language-md line-numbers-mode\" data-highlighter=\"shiki\" data-ext=\"md\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code\" v-pre=\"\"><code class=\"language-md\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#D4976C\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> Red</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#D4976C\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> Green</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#D4976C\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> Blue</span></span></code></pre>\n<div class=\"line-numbers\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"counter-reset:line-number 0\"><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div></div></div><p>有序列表则使用数字接着一个英文句点:</p>\n<div class=\"language-md line-numbers-mode\" data-highlighter=\"shiki\" data-ext=\"md\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code\" v-pre=\"\"><code class=\"language-md\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#D4976C\">1.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">  Bird</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#D4976C\">2.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">  McHale</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#D4976C\">3.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">  Parish</span></span></code></pre>\n<div class=\"line-numbers\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"counter-reset:line-number 0\"><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div></div></div><p>列表也可以通过<kbd>Tab</kbd>进行层级划分。</p>\n<h4 id=\"分隔线\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#分隔线\"><span>分隔线</span></a></h4>\n<p>三个连续的减号为分割线</p>\n<div class=\"hint-container info\">\n<p class=\"hint-container-title\">相关信息</p>\n<p>本百科二级标题上方自动有一条分隔线</p>\n</div>\n<h4 id=\"链接\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#链接\"><span>链接</span></a></h4>\n<p>链接的文字用 <code v-pre>[方括号]</code> 来标记，链接地址用<code v-pre>(圆括号)</code>标记。</p>\n<p><mark>方括号内的文字何以自定义</mark></p>\n<div class=\"language-html line-numbers-mode\" data-highlighter=\"shiki\" data-ext=\"html\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code\" v-pre=\"\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">[百度](http://www.baidu.com)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">行内链接：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">[列表](#列表)</span></span></code></pre>\n<div class=\"line-numbers\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"counter-reset:line-number 0\"><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div></div></div><p><a href=\"http://www.baidu.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">百度</a>和<a href=\"#%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8\">列表</a></p>\n<h4 id=\"加粗\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#加粗\"><span>加粗</span></a></h4>\n<div class=\"language-md line-numbers-mode\" data-highlighter=\"shiki\" data-ext=\"md\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code\" v-pre=\"\"><code class=\"language-md\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#666666;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">double asterisks</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#666666;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> (建议)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#666666;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">double underscores</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#666666;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> (建议)</span></span></code></pre>\n<div class=\"line-numbers\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"counter-reset:line-number 0\"><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div><div class=\"line-number\"></div></div></div><h4 id=\"代码\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#代码\"><span>代码</span></a></h4>\n<p>如果要标记一小段行内代码，你可以用反引号把它包起来 (<code v-pre>`</code>)</p>\n<p>你可以用它来表示游戏中某些特殊名称或者物品</p>\n<p><Plot>代码标记里为什么一定要是代码呢</Plot></p>\n<h4 id=\"图片\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#图片\"><span>图片</span></a></h4>\n<p><a href=\"#%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5\">链接</a>格式前加一个<code v-pre>!</code>地址为图片路径<br>\n<code v-pre>docs</code>文件夹下为根目录，请将文章所用图片新建一个文件并放进<code v-pre>blog</code>/<code v-pre>image</code>文件夹<br>\n<mark class=\"warning\">使用发布页面会自动放进正确的位置直接引用就好</mark></p>\n<h4 id=\"其他文本样式\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#其他文本样式\"><span>其他文本样式</span></a></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>删除:<code v-pre>~~delete~~</code></li>\n<li>段落: 段落之间空一行</li>\n<li>换行符: 一行结束时输入两个空格</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"表格\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#表格\"><span>表格</span></a></h4>\n<p>请尽量不要使用表格<Plot>不是很好用</Plot></p>\n<div class=\"language-md line-numbers-mode\" data-highlighter=\"shiki\" data-ext=\"md\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code\" v-pre=\"\"><code class=\"language-md\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">     居中      </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">         右对齐 </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> 左对齐         </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> :-----------:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> -------------:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> :-------------</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> 居中使用</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">`</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">:-:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">`</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> 右对齐使用</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">`</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">-:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">`</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> 左对齐使用</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">`</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">:-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">`</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">       b       </span